span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//row_ids, col_ids integer arrays</span></div></code></div><br></div><div>that weren&#39;t previously possible. Hope that helps, </div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div>Jonah</div><div><br></div></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
